NON-FREE IMAGES
---------------

loc_training_camp.png
---------------------
Based on:
http://flickr.com/photos/mthird3rd/471720012/

Martin Third writes:
  I'm happy to allow you to use the image for your Tennix game, but I'd
  rather keep the "All rights reserved" copyright, if this is acceptable.

License for this photo therefore:

  Copyright (c) 2007 Martin Third <Mthird3rd@aol.com> All Rights Reserved.
  Permission to use this image in Tennix.



We still need to get permission for these pictures to use them (and try to
not include it in the source tarball - you'll find it here in the Git repo):

